      "currency": "USD",
      "description": "Looking for something special? Shop the Etsy app—your global online marketplace and shopping app for original items made, handpicked, and designed by real people for all budgets. Explore over 5 million independent small shops selling everything from vintage treasures and one-of-a-kind finds, to personalized pieces that make a statement. The app makes it easy to chat with sellers, track your orders, save favorites and more.\n\nSupport small shops this season by shopping for unique finds from real people. From seasonal decor and meaningful holiday gift giving, to stocking the perfect winter wardrobe—Etsy has you covered.\n \nSHOP HANDMADE, ONE-OF-A-KIND FINDS\nExplore over 15+ marketplace categories of original items from all over the world, including:\n• Home Goods & Decor: Find furniture, glassware, art prints and more to style your own space or to gift to someone who loves theirs.\n • New & Vintage Clothes: Clothes for men, women, and children—shop for a wardrobe that feels like you.*\n• Jewelry & Accessories: Accessorize your looks with unique and handmade rings, earrings, and necklaces.\n• Original Art, Collectibles & Digital Downloads: Pick up finds from around the world, like Turkish pottery, Portuguese ceramics and custom prints.\n• DIY Ideas: Get all the supplies and craft kits you need to throw a themed party or learn a new hobby.\n\nSAVE WITH MARKETPLACE OFFERS & DEALS\nShop top offers and deals from small shops with curated selections of items on sale from sellers you love. Stay updated on sales for your favorite pieces with push notifications!\n\nSEARCH BY IMAGE, LOCATION & MORE\nSkip the scrolling, find the good stuff. Search by image or filter by shop location, budget and more to discover just what you’re looking for. \n\nHow do I track my order in the Etsy app?\nOpen your order to see real-time status updates, and turn on notifications to get alerts as your order progresses.\n\nCan I message a seller before I buy?\nYes! Chat with Etsy sellers in the app to ask questions about an item or your order. \n\nWhat payment methods does Etsy accept?\nCredit/debit, Etsy gift cards, Paypal, Klarna, and quick purchases with Apple Pay for safe, secure payments.\n\nFAVORITE, ORGANIZE & CREATE LISTS\nFavorite shops, save items, and organize your pieces in collections for future inspiration. Or, create a gift list of your favorite items and save special occasions for helpful reminders.\n\nPERSONALIZE GIFTS & CUSTOM FINDS\nPersonalize clothes, jewelry, decor, and other style essentials to make your gift ideas one-of-a-kind.\n\nWhat gifts can I find on Etsy?\n Explore gift guides for every occasion, including:\n• Birthdays\n• Anniversaries\n• Engagements\n• Weddings\n• Holidays\n• Her, Him & Pets\n• & so much more!\nPlus, send a custom preview message so the recipient knows the gift is on the way!\n\nGET INSPIRED\nBrowse new and trending items or shop collections curated specifically for you to discover the latest in home, style, and more.\n\nIs Etsy safe to shop from?\nYes—shop online with confidence. Etsy Purchase Protection ensures you are protected in the event there is an issue with your order. Plus, leave and read item and shop reviews from real people.\n\nCan I sell on Etsy from this app?\nDownload the Etsy Seller app to create listings, manage orders, and sell to buyers all over the world.\n\nWhat is Etsy best for?\nDiscover personalized, handmade, and one-of-a-kind items for every occasion from a global community of talented sellers—from clothing and furniture to art, decor, and more.\n\nDownload today.\n \n*Etsy does not evaluate vintage items’ condition and authenticity.",
